		{
			"id": "HroiPNbP",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -168.30581485523896,
			"y": 603.0861408009248,
			"width": 303.21990966796875,
			"height": 250,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b04",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 293486673,
			"version": 608,
			"versionNonce": 1601975775,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1790648758039,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "此时根据L1 buffer以及L0C的限制\n（要求A1+B1<=L1 buffer），\n我们在假设，\nstepM: 2  \nstepN: 1  \nstepKa: 4 \nstepKb: 2\ndepthA1: 8\ndepthB1: 4\n",
			"rawText": "此时根据L1 buffer以及L0C的限制\n（要求A1+B1<=L1 buffer），\n我们在假设，\nstepM: 2  \nstepN: 1  \nstepKa: 4 \nstepKb: 2\ndepthA1: 8\ndepthB1: 4\n",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "此时根据L1 buffer以及L0C的限制\n（要求A1+B1<=L1 buffer），\n我们在假设，\nstepM: 2  \nstepN: 1  \nstepKa: 4 \nstepKb: 2\ndepthA1: 8\ndepthB1: 4\n",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"labelPosition": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
		{
			"id": "MSkLYk7J",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 181.2000732421875,
			"y": 567.8624649047852,
			"width": 672.579833984375,
			"height": 75,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b05",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 2069638335,
			"version": 129,
			"versionNonce": 1061562879,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1790645264395,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "可以计算得到单次mmad指令A小块消耗的空间 128*128*2=32768B=32KB\n可以计算得到单次mmad指令B小块消耗的空间 128*128*2=32768B=32KB\n可以计算得到单次mmad指令C小块消耗的空间 128*128*4=65536B=64KB",
			"rawText": "可以计算得到单次mmad指令A小块消耗的空间 128*128*2=32768B=32KB\n可以计算得到单次mmad指令B小块消耗的空间 128*128*2=32768B=32KB\n可以计算得到单次mmad指令C小块消耗的空间 128*128*4=65536B=64KB",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "可以计算得到单次mmad指令A小块消耗的空间 128*128*2=32768B=32KB\n可以计算得到单次mmad指令B小块消耗的空间 128*128*2=32768B=32KB\n可以计算得到单次mmad指令C小块消耗的空间 128*128*4=65536B=64KB",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
